ver 1 Agility at the start of the next turn. This opens up more strategic options, even without Agility-related skills. ■ Friendlier Term Explanations Terms that appear in skill and relic descriptions now have their meanings shown right bel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:45:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043987","verified_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074650-1847286114039384","game_id":"steam-5074650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Improvements to Game Systems","summary":"Hello!Thank you so much for all the downloads and feedback on the demo!Based on your survey responses, we've rolled out a fairly big update.It changes how the game feels quite a bit, so even if you've already cleared the demo, please give it another go.■ The Best Defense Is a Good OffenseRelics that boost Shield now also grant Shield when attached to an attack skill and that skill is used.This makes builds with three attack skills viable and gives you much more freedom in how you build. (That sa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:07:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039384","verified_at":"2026-10-24T13:54:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074650-1847286114033351","game_id":"steam-5074650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Skill Rerolls, Tags & Clearer Tutorials","summary":"We've received some great feedback through the demo survey. Thank you so much!! Based on your suggestions, we've already made the following updates. ■ Skill Tags, Rerolls & Appearance Rates Skills now display tags, making it easier to spot skills that work well with the ones you already have. You can now reroll skills! Skipping a skill selection grants one extra reroll, and you can reroll the offered skills one card at a time. We've adjusted skill appearance rates so you're a little more likely ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:12:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033351","verified_at":"2026-10-22T18:06:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074650-1846018067938860","game_id":"steam-5074650","kind":"update","title":"Big Visual Update for the Demo! Almost Everything Looks New + 2 New Languages","summary":"Thank you as always for playing the Memento Resonance demo! Since the demo launched, I've been doing nothing but polishing how the game looks. Before I knew it, almost every screen had turned into something new, so here it is as a big update! There are far too many small changes to list, so here are just the highlights. 🌏 Now available in Traditional Chinese and Russian! So many of you who added the game to your wishlist use these two languages that I made them playable starting with this update","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T16:41:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938860","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074650-1844115010501839","game_id":"steam-5074650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"We've updated the demo! This update mainly focuses on smoothing out the early-game difficulty and improving the pacing of the story. “We slightly overshot.” We've adjusted the HP, attack power, and some status effects of several elites and bosses in Layer 1, making the beginning of the game a little more forgiving. For reference, the boss clear rate in the previous version was 9.1%. If you cleared it... you might just be a pro at this genre! “Too much!” The opening story was skippable, but it st","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T16:18:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501839","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074650-1842846814444941","game_id":"steam-5074650","kind":"announcement","title":"Memento Resonance Free Demo Now Available!","summary":"The free demo of Memento Resonance is now available! Memento Resonance is a monster-collecting roguelite turn-based strategy game in which you form bonds with monsters encountered as enemies and climb the tower together. Unable to fight on her own, a girl named Koharu enters a colossal tower in pursuit of her father's shadow. Offer food to monsters during battle and form “Resonance” with them to welcome them as new allies. Relics found during your journey can be equipped to your allies' skills. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T00:18:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814444941","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5074650-1840944183784109","game_id":"steam-5074650","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Steam Page Is Live — See You at Steam Next Fest in October 2026","summary":"Our Steam Store Page Is Now Live Hello from Lipcat Games! The Steam store page for Memento Resonance is now live. Koharu is a girl with no power to fight. In pursuit of her father's shadow, she borrows the strength of monsters and sets out for the summit of a colossal tower. Memento Resonance is a monster-collecting roguelite turn-based strategy game centered on forging Resonance with monsters, customizing skills with relics, responding to telegraphed enemy actions, and following the trail of lo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T15:37:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784109","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:39:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5074650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:56Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5074650":"2026-10-26T07:59:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5074650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:56Z"},"5178930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:59:56Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5074650","app_id":5074650,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:23Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"fa5c7df2ee60b628f35bbd691a694490258cbb938263df9784e5916a61d64413","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Forge a Resonance with enemy monsters and welcome them into your party. Equip their skills with relics to shape your own battle style, then climb an ever-changing tower as you follow the trail of lost memories in this monster-collecting roguelite turn-based strategy game.","publishers":[{"name":"Lipcat Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Lipcat Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796025600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Memento Resonance - Official Trail